  "faq": [
    {
      "q": "How far in advance should I book my event?",
      "a": "We recommend booking at least 2-3 weeks in advance to secure your preferred date and time."
    },
    {
      "q": "Does everyone need to sign a waiver?",
      "a": "Yes, anyone participating in activities must sign a waiver."
    },
    {
      "q": "Can I bring outside food or a birthday cake?",
      "a": "Outside food and drinks are not allowed, but you may bring a store-bought cake or dessert for celebrations."
    },
    {
      "q": "How early can I arrive to set up?",
      "a": "30 minutes prior to your event start time."
    },
    {
      "q": "What is required for booking a pre-planned event?",
      "a": "Booking an event space, activity selections and a minimum food & beverage spend of $100 for birthday parties and $40 per person for adult social gatherings and corporate events."
    },
    {
      "q": "Can I add food on the day of my event?",
      "a": "Yes! However, food ordered on the day will come from the regular restaurant menu, not the catering menu. It may also take longer if there are other guest orders at the same time."
    },
    {
      "q": "Can I bring decorations?",
      "a": "Yes! You are welcome to bring themed decorations. However, confetti, glitter, and silly string are not allowed. In a private event room, only tape may be used to attach banners to walls."
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you provide decorations?",
      "a": "We provide tablecloths, plates, napkins, cups, and utensils in red, blue, green, purple, pink, or black."
    },
    {
      "q": "Can I reserve bowling lanes?",
      "a": "Bowling lanes can be pre-booked through private event packages. Otherwise, lanes are first-come, first-served."
    },
    {
      "q": "Is there a minimum or maximum number of participants?",
      "a": "Minimum: 10 participants. Maximum: No limit!"
    },
    {
      "q": "Can I book just a party room?",
      "a": "No, party rooms are reserved for guests who book a full event package."
    },
    {
      "q": "Can I request a custom event package?",
      "a": "Yes! We can customize event packages based on your needs. Contact our event team to discuss options."
    },
    {
      "q": "Can I extend my event?",
      "a": "Extensions may be possible based on availability. Additional fees may apply."
    },
    {
      "q": "What shoes are needed for go-karts and axe throwing?",
      "a": "Closed-toed shoes are required; crocs and sandals are not permitted. Pro races need age 14+ and 62 inches tall; axe throwing is 18+."
    }
  ],
